# and boot-timing this NEVER replaces an upstream file. csf_scale_decode.pth is a
# new file mounted into site-packages; it installs a sys.meta_path hook that wraps
# one upstream method post-import, looked up by name. If upstream renames or
# removes it the hook prints "[csf-scale-decode] NOT applied ..." and vLLM then
# fails on a CSF checkpoint exactly as it does without this patch.
#
