#   vllm.model_executor.model_loader.default_loader
#       DefaultModelLoader.get_all_weights(self, model_config, model)
#           -- generator of (name, tensor); yields from _get_weights_iterator(
#              primary_weights) then the model's secondary_weights sources.
#              Wrapped, not replaced: every non-CSF pair passes through.
#   Re-grepped at fe8f214 (2026-10-18): default_loader.py is byte-identical since
#   4d9a8d6 (get_all_weights still :367). Still needed: `git grep -iE
#   'nvfp4_csf|csf_exceptions|byte-window4'` over vllm/ at fe8f214 returns nothing.
#   test_csf_scale_decode.py passes.
#
